    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is based on a Chinese urban legend</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in <strong>1995</strong> in Beijing, China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a late night commuter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700790/extras/e819ba19990fc71ccf0423c9674c992c.avif?t=1747257871\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the <strong>last bus</strong> home that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first everything is normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700790/extras/9f79d57082e983c2dfe30e3c835e332c.avif?t=1747257871\" data-has-big width=800 height=418 /></span><strong>But gradually, the surroundings become frightening and scary!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The sudden appearance of paper figures and the falling paper money in the sky will scare you to death!</u></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700790/extras/503525c15ee218ef8427a33dbbac1a5d.avif?t=1747257871\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Get out of here!</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700790/extras/cd60e2c422780793be29765590c57f92.avif?t=1747257871\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>It's too late!</strong></i></u></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is based on a Chinese urban legend</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in <strong>1995</strong> in Beijing, China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a late night commuter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700790/extras/e819ba19990fc71ccf0423c9674c992c.avif?t=1747257871\" data-has-big width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the <strong>last bus</strong> home that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first everything is normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700790/extras/9f79d57082e983c2dfe30e3c835e332c.avif?t=1747257871\" data-has-big width=800 height=418 /></span><strong>But gradually, the surroundings become frightening and scary!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The sudden appearance of paper figures and the falling paper money in the sky will scare you to death!</u></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700790/extras/503525c15ee218ef8427a33dbbac1a5d.avif?t=1747257871\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out of here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Get out of here!</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700790/extras/cd60e2c422780793be29765590c57f92.avif?t=1747257871\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>It's too late!</strong></i></u></p>",
    "short_description": "In The Final Ride, you play a late-night office worker making your way home. In 30\u201360 minutes, dive into a bite-sized Chinese urban horror based on folk legends. Solve puzzles, flee relentless phantoms, scavenge vital items, and brace for jump scares\u2014uncover three unique endings.",
